<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
<meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge"/>
<title>NexaPay — Verify your account</title>
<style>
  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    background-color: #F0F2F8;
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    padding: 40px 16px;
  }
  .wrapper {
    max-width: 520px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* Header */
  .header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .logo-wrap {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .logo-icon {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    background: #1A1F5E;
    border-radius: 12px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .logo-name {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #1A1F5E;
    letter-spacing: -0.4px;
  }

  /* Card */
  .card {
    background: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 24px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 24px rgba(26, 31, 94, 0.08);
  }

  /* Card top stripe */
  .card-stripe {
    height: 6px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #1A1F5E 0%, #4F5BD5 100%);
  }

  /* Card body */
  .card-body {
    padding: 40px 40px 36px;
  }

  /* Greeting */
  .greeting {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #1A1F5E;
    letter-spacing: -0.4px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .subtext {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #9094A6;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  /* OTP Box */
  .otp-label {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #9094A6;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .otp-box {
    background: #F4F6FA;
    border: 1.5px solid #E2E5F1;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 24px;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .otp-code {
    font-size: 42px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #1A1F5E;
    letter-spacing: 10px;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .otp-expiry {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #9094A6;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }
  .otp-expiry strong {
    color: #E07B39;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  /* Divider */
  .divider {
    height: 1px;
    background: #F0F1F7;
    margin: 28px 0;
  }

  /* Security note */
  .security-box {
    background: #FFF8E1;
    border: 1px solid #FFE082;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  .security-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 1px;
  }
  .security-text {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #8B5E0A;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .security-text strong {
    font-weight: 700;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }

  /* CTA Button */
  .btn-wrap {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  .btn {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #1A1F5E;
    color: #ffffff !important;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 14px 40px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    letter-spacing: 0.2px;
  }

  /* Help text */
  .help-text {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #9094A6;
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .help-text a {
    color: #4F5BD5;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* Footer */
  .footer {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 28px;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }
  .footer-logo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .footer-icon {
    width: 26px;
    height: 26px;
    background: #1A1F5E;
    border-radius: 8px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .footer-name {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #1A1F5E;
  }
  .footer-text {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #B0B4CA;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .footer-links {
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .footer-links a {
    color: #9094A6;
    text-decoration: none;
    margin: 0 8px;
  }
  .footer-links a:hover {
    color: #4F5BD5;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrapper">

  <!-- Logo header -->
  <div class="header">
    <div class="logo-wrap">
      <div class="logo-icon">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
          <path d="M13 2L4.09 12.11A2 2 0 004 13v7a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2v-7a2 2 0 00-.09-.89L11 2" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          <path d="M12 22V12" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <span class="logo-name">NexaPay</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Main card -->
  <div class="card">
    <div class="card-stripe"></div>
    <div class="card-body">

      <p class="greeting">Hi {{name}},</p>
      <p class="subtext">
        You requested to verify your NexaPay account. Use the code below to complete your verification. This code is valid for a limited time.
      </p>

      <p class="otp-label">Your verification code</p>
      <div class="otp-box">
        <div class="otp-code">{{otp}}</div>
      </div>
      <p class="otp-expiry">This code expires in <strong>{{expiryMinutes}} minutes</strong></p>

      <div class="divider"></div>

      <!-- Security note -->
      <div class="security-box">
        <div class="security-icon">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="#E07B39" stroke-width="2"/>
            <path d="M12 8v4M12 16h.01" stroke="#E07B39" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="security-text">
          <strong>Never share this code</strong>
          NexaPay will never ask for your OTP via phone, email, or chat. If you didn't request this, please ignore this email or contact our support team immediately.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="help-text">
        Having trouble? <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}">Contact support</a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <div class="footer">
    <div class="footer-logo">
      <div class="footer-icon">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
          <path d="M13 2L4.09 12.11A2 2 0 004 13v7a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2v-7a2 2 0 00-.09-.89L11 2" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          <path d="M12 22V12" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <span class="footer-name">NexaPay</span>
    </div>
    <p class="footer-text">
      Secure. Fast. Simple.<br/>
      This email was sent to {{email}}. If you did not create a NexaPay account, you can safely ignore this email.
    </p>
    <div class="footer-links">
      <a href="#">Privacy Policy</a>
      <a href="#">Terms of Service</a>
      <a href="#">Help Center</a>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
</body>
</html>